{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1509994721"}, "name":{"label":"✨🌻Review Person🌻✨"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-03-18T20:19:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.71.1"}, "id":{"label":"9728504673"}, "title":{"label":"Hydrate before you die-drate!"}, "content":{"label":"Hydrate before you die-drate! I love this app! Before this app I never drank enough water. Now I am so motivated by this app and I’m forever drinking water! \n\nI would like to say, I just want more characters to drink water with, without having to pay! It’s sometimes very boring, having just one animal to stay hydrated with. My suggestion is to add a few more animals to hydrate with to make it a bit more enjoyable and interesting.\nI love this app and it’s fun widgets. I also love how you can change the app logo to match your style or your Home Screen! \n\nThank you for motivating me to drink more water and stay hydrated!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
